(4, 3, 'That sounds useful. How do you gather user feedback?', datetime('now', '-318 days'), true),
(4, 5, 'Surveys, user interviews, analytics data, and support tickets. Multiple sources give a complete picture.', datetime('now', '-318 days'), true),
(4, 3, 'Makes sense. How do you handle competing priorities from different stakeholders?', datetime('now', '-317 days'), true),
